From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pine Drama Studio Authors <authors@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 17:25:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 01/32] pine(L3): trim workbench contributions to what the
 extension API and chat need

Comment out the views and features of debug, SCM, tasks, merge editor,
remote, remote tunnel, surveys, the welcome page and its walkthroughs,
and the notebook REPL. Update stays: the Studio updates itself (app.ts). Keep their services where the
extension host's main-thread API, chat, notebooks or editor signals use
them: debug.service.contribution is imported directly; scm.service,
quickDiff, testing, interactive, tasks' taskService, issue and
extensionHostDebugService stay. Found by removing them one at a time
and starting the Studio after each.

